# Security and secrets

- Never create, request, display, store, or commit secrets or `.env` values.
- Never touch seed phrases, private keys, wallet recovery data, or signers.
- Routine GitHub transport under `STANDING_PROJECT_AUTONOMY` is allowed for
  exact contract reads, exact named-Issue receipt comments, fetch/read-back,
  non-force task-branch push, PR/review, and CI interaction. Unrelated Issue
  discovery or mutation remains forbidden.
- Public official-document reads are allowed when decision-relevant.
- Provider/API/RPC/WSS, credentials, account/settings changes, package
  adoption, purchase/deploy, wallet/signer/transaction, and real money remain
  explicit excluded gates.
- No absolute machine paths, usernames, or account emails in tracked artifacts.
- `.env.example` remains placeholder-only.
- See `AGENTS.md` sections `NO_SECRETS`, `EXTERNAL_ACTIONS`, and `WORKSPACE_ONLY`.
